/reference/location/coverage_report $defs — no 'receipt'","search for 'receipt' under src/rebar/grounding returns no matches","src/rebar/schemas has no *receipt* schema file","AC asserts 'schema-valid canonical evidence/receipts' without naming the receipt's schema"],"finding":"The plan requires schema-valid 'receipts' and cites grounding.schema.json as authoritative, but that schema defines no receipt object and no receipt schema exists in the repo; the receipt's field vocabulary is prose-only with no co-located validating schema.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fa627cd7d5446c289","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Scope → Operations and receipts ('Return canonical JSON containing evidence, safe structural facts, and a receipt: normalized query, snapshot/module digest, ...'); AC 'return schema-valid canonical evidence/receipts'; Testing card 'Authoritative contract: ... grounding.schema.json'","norm_id":"n3f5e209a9872437c","priority":1.0,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["An implementer must emit a receipt with backend/analyzer versions, effective limits, and result digest but has no schema to validate against, so the contract test 'schema-valid canonical ... receipts' has no oracle","Pass-1 and Pass-2 sessions serialize receipts with divergent field names/shapes, defeating the 'exact ... receipt' oracle"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"insufficient","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},