ach triggering a Pass-2 verifier."],"finding":"The plan states 'Immutable parse bytes may be reused' across Pass 1 and Pass 2 but does not define who owns the reusable byte/parse cache or its retirement path — whether it is retired at end of the agent call, evicted under memory pressure, or could accumulate across many findings/verifiers in a batch review.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fd7dd2f3d64f5e618","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan-review integration: 'Immutable parse bytes may be reused, but query ledgers are per call.'","norm_id":"n65d61896380abe3d","priority":0.066,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add one sentence: the immutable byte snapshot is owned by the enclosing review-batch scope and is retired (freed) when that scope ends; Pass-2 reuse borrows read-only from it and never extends its lifetime, and per-call query ledgers are always discarded at the end of each agent call.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.25,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.7,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Specify 